neric interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Source Code subroutine initial_setup_gauss_integration_rule ( self , num_gauss ) implicit none class ( type_gauss_integration_rule ), intent ( inout ) :: self integer ( int32 ), intent ( in ) :: num_gauss integer ( int32 ) :: i call deallocate_array ( self % weight ) if ( allocated ( self % gauss )) deallocate ( self % gauss ) call allocate_array ( self % weight , num_gauss ) allocate ( self % gauss ( num_gauss )) self % weight (:) = 0.0d0 do i = 1 , num_gauss call self % gauss ( i )% reset () end do end subroutine initial_setup_gauss_integration_rule","tags":"","url":"proc/initial_setup_gauss_integration_rule.html"},{"title":"initialize_type_gauss_integration_rule – FTDSS","text":"private  subroutine initialize_type_gauss_integration_rule(self, cell_type, integration_order) 指定されたセルタイプと積分次数に応じたガウス積分ルールを初期化する Type Bound type_gauss_integration_rule Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( type_gauss_integration_rule ), intent(inout) :: self integer(kind=int32), intent(in) :: cell_type integer(kind=int32), intent(in) :: integration_order Calls proc~~initialize_type_gauss_integration_rule~~CallsGraph proc~initialize_type_gauss_integration_rule type_gauss_integration_rule%initialize_type_gauss_integration_rule proc~compute_line_rule_gauss_integration type_gauss_integration_rule%compute_line_rule_gauss_integration proc~initialize_type_gauss_integration_rule->proc~compute_line_rule_gauss_integration proc~compute_quad_rule_gauss_integration type_gauss_integration_rule%compute_quad_rule_gauss_integration proc~initialize_type_gauss_integration_rule->proc~compute_quad_rule_gauss_integration proc~compute_triangle_rule_gauss_integration type_gauss_integration_rule%compute_triangle_rule_gauss_integration proc~initialize_type_gauss_integration_rule->proc~comput