:"","url":"proc/get_next_time.html"},{"title":"is_enabled – FTDSS","text":"private pure function is_enabled(self) result(is_active) 出力が有効かどうかを判定する Type Bound type_output_manager Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( type_output_manager ), intent(in) :: self Return Value logical Called by proc~~is_enabled~~CalledByGraph proc~is_enabled type_output_manager%is_enabled proc~update_controls type_controls%update_controls proc~update_controls->proc~is_enabled proc~run_ftdss run_ftdss proc~run_ftdss->proc~update_controls interface~run_ftdss type_ftdss%run_ftdss interface~run_ftdss->proc~run_ftdss Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Source Code pure function is_enabled ( self ) result ( is_active ) implicit none class ( type_output_manager ), intent ( in ) :: self logical :: is_active is_active = self % is_active end function is_enabled","tags":"","url":"proc/is_enabled.html"},{"title":"get_next_target_time – FTDSS","text":"private  subroutine get_next_target_time(self, current_time, target_time) 現在時刻に基づき，次に同期すべきターゲット時刻を返す Type Bound type_output_manager Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( type_output_manager ), intent(in) :: self real(kind=real64), intent(in) :: current_time real(kind=real64), intent(inout) :: target_time Called by proc~~get_next_target_time~~CalledByGraph proc~get_next_target_time type_output_manager%get_next_target_time proc~update_controls type_controls%update_controls proc~update_controls->proc~get_next_target_time proc~run_ftdss run_ftdss proc~run_ftdss->proc~update_controls interface~run_ftdss type_ftdss%run_ftdss interface~run_ftdss->proc~run_ftdss Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Source Code subroutine get_next_target_time ( self , current_time , target_time ) implicit none class ( type_output_manager ), intent ( in ) :: self real ( real64 ), intent ( in ) :: current_time real ( real64 ), intent ( inout ) :: target_time real ( real64 ), parameter :: tolerance = 1.0d-9 if (. not . self % is_active ) then target_time = 1.0d+30 ! 無効なら十分遠い未来 return end if ! もし現在時刻がすでに出力予定時刻に達している（または過ぎている）なら， ! その「次の間隔」をターゲットとする if ( current_time >= self % next_output_seconds - tolerance ) then target_time = self % next_output_seconds + self % interval_seconds else target_time = self % next_output_seconds end if end subroutine get_next_target_time","tags":"","url":"proc/get_next_target_time.html"},{"title":"get_step – FTDSS","text":"private pure subroutine get_step(self, step) Type Bound type_output_manager Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( type_output_manager ), intent(in) :: self integer(kind=int32), intent(inout) :: step Called by proc~~get_step~~CalledByGraph proc~get_step type_output_manager%get_step