ne calc_dpsi_square_second(self, i, j, r, dpsi_val) Interface → Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( type_square_second ), intent(in) :: self integer(kind=int32), intent(in) :: i integer(kind=int32), intent(in) :: j type( type_coordinate_dp ), intent(in) :: r real(kind=real64), intent(inout) :: dpsi_val Called by proc~~calc_dpsi_square_second~~CalledByGraph proc~calc_dpsi_square_second calc_dpsi_square_second interface~calc_dpsi_square_second type_square_second%calc_dpsi_square_second interface~calc_dpsi_square_second->proc~calc_dpsi_square_second proc~calc_jacobian_square_second calc_jacobian_square_second proc~calc_jacobian_square_second->interface~calc_dpsi_square_second interface~calc_jacobian_square_second type_square_second%calc_jacobian_square_second interface~calc_jacobian_square_second->proc~calc_jacobian_square_second proc~is_in_square_second is_in_square_second proc~is_in_square_second->interface~calc_jacobian_square_second interface~is_in_square_second type_square_second%is_in_square_second interface~is_in_square_second->proc~is_in_square_second Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Source Code pure elemental module subroutine calc_dpsi_square_second ( self , i , j , r , dpsi_val ) implicit none class ( type_square_second ), intent ( in ) :: self integer ( int32 ), intent ( in ) :: i integer ( int32 ), intent ( in ) :: j type ( type_coordinate_dp ), intent ( in ) :: r real ( real64 ), intent ( inout ) :: dpsi_val real ( real64 ) :: xi real ( real64 ) :: eta xi = r % x eta = r % y dpsi_val = 0.0d0 if ( j == 1 ) then ! d/dxi select case ( i ) case ( 1 ) dpsi_val = 0.25d0 * ( 1.0d0 - eta ) * ( 2.0d0 * xi + eta ) case ( 2 ) dpsi_val = 0.25d0 * ( 1.0d0 - eta ) * ( 2.0d0 * xi - eta ) case ( 3 ) dpsi_val = 0.25d0 * ( 1.0d0 + eta ) * ( 2.0d0 * xi + eta ) case ( 4 ) dpsi_val = 0.25d0 * ( 1.0d0 + eta ) * ( 2.0d0 * xi - eta ) case ( 5 ) dpsi_val = - xi * ( 1.0d0 - eta ) case ( 6 ) dpsi_val = 0.5d0 * ( 1.0d0 - eta ** 2 ) case ( 7 ) dpsi_val = - xi * ( 1.0d0 + eta ) case ( 8 ) dpsi_val = - 0.5d0 * ( 1.0d0 - eta ** 2 ) end select else if ( j == 2 ) then ! d/deta select case ( i ) case ( 1 ) dpsi_val = 0.25d0 * ( 1.0d0 - xi ) * ( xi + 2.0d0 * eta ) case ( 2 ) dpsi_val = 0.25d0 * ( 1.0d0 + xi ) * ( - xi + 2.0d0 * eta ) case ( 3 ) dpsi_val = 0.25d0 * ( 1.0d0 + xi ) * ( xi + 2.0d0 * eta ) case ( 4 ) dpsi_val = 0.25d0 * ( 1.0d0 - xi ) * ( - xi + 2.0d0 * eta ) case ( 5 ) dpsi_val = - 0.5d0 * ( 1.0d0 - xi ** 2 ) case ( 6 ) dpsi_val = - eta * ( 1.0d0 + xi ) case ( 7 ) dpsi_val = 0.5d0 * ( 1.0d0 - xi ** 2 ) case ( 8 ) dpsi_val = - eta * ( 1.0d0 - xi ) end select end if end subroutine calc_dpsi_square_second","tags":"","url":"proc/calc_dpsi_square_second.html"},{"title":"calc_jacobian_square_second – FTDSS","text":"pure module subroutine calc_jacobian_square_second(self, r, node_coords, jac) Interface → Calculates the Jacobian matrix.\nStandard definition: J(i, j) = d(x_i) / d(xi_j)\nRow 1: dx/dxi, dx/deta\nRow 2: dy/dxi, dy/deta Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( type_square_second ), intent(in) :: self type( type_coordinate_dp ), intent(in) :: r real(kind=real64), intent(in) :: node_coords (:,:) real(kind=real64), intent(inout) :: jac (:,:) Calls proc~~calc_jacobian_square_second~~CallsGraph proc~calc_jacobian_square_second calc_jacobian_square_second interface~calc_d