er call pos % set ( 0.0d0 , 0.0d0 , 0.0d0 ) do i = 1 , nn call self % calc_psi ( i , r , val ) pos % x = pos % x + val * node_coords ( 1 , i ) pos % y = pos % y + val * node_coords ( 2 , i ) end do dx = cartesian % x - pos % x dy = cartesian % y - pos % y if ( sqrt ( dx ** 2 + dy ** 2 ) < tol ) then converged = . true . exit end if call self % calc_jacobian_determinant ( r , node_coords , det_j ) if ( abs ( det_j ) < epsilon ( det_j )) exit call self % calc_jacobian ( r , node_coords , jac ) ! 2x2 Inverse Jacobian update: ! [dxi ]   1   [ J22  -J12 ] [ dx ] ! [deta] = det [ -J21  J11 ] [ dy ] ! ! r_new = r_old + J_inv * delta_x ! ! J(1,1)=x_xi, J(1,2)=x_eta ! J(2,1)=y_xi, J(2,2)=y_eta r % x = r % x + ( jac ( 2 , 2 ) * dx - jac ( 1 , 2 ) * dy ) / det_j r % y = r % y + ( - jac ( 2 , 1 ) * dx + jac ( 1 , 1 ) * dy ) / det_j end do is_in = converged . and . ( r % x >= - tol ) . and . ( r % y >= - tol ) . and . ( r % x + r % y <= 1.0d0 + tol ) if ( is_in ) normalized = r end subroutine is_in_triangle_second","tags":"","url":"proc/is_in_triangle_second.html"},{"title":"destroy_type_solver_gmres – FTDSS","text":"module subroutine destroy_type_solver_gmres(self) Interface → Finalize the GMRES solver instance and release memory. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( type_solver_gmres ), intent(inout) :: self Solver instance to be destroyed Calls proc~~destroy_type_solver_gmres~~CallsGraph proc~destroy_type_solver_gmres destroy_type_solver_gmres deallocate_array deallocate_array proc~destroy_type_solver_gmres->deallocate_array interface~destroy_vector_dp type_vector_dp%destroy_vector_dp proc~destroy_type_solver_gmres->interface~destroy_vector_dp proc~destroy_vector_dp destroy_vector_dp interface~destroy_vector_dp->proc~destroy_vector_dp proc~destroy_vector_dp->deallocate_array Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown 